/**
@page overviews Overviews

@brief Orientation guides - the model and the data flows, before the per-class API.

Start here for the shape of the system. Each guide walks one slice with ASCII
diagrams; the @ref deepdives cover specific mechanisms in more detail.

- @subpage md_docs_2CONCURRENCY - **Concurrency model.** The single cooperative
  loop, the per-tick cycle contract, and why plain `volatile` + barriers replace
  locks and `std::atomic`.
- @subpage md_docs_2CONTEXTS - **Contexts.** The per-subsystem status structs and
  the `SystemContext` aggregate the read-only UI paths borrow.
- @subpage md_docs_2PAGES - **Pages.** The page hierarchy and the screen contract
  every full-screen view shares.
- @subpage md_docs_2EVENT__DISPATCH - **Event dispatch.** How input events flow
  from the serial port through the parser to the active page.
- @subpage md_docs_2LOG__FLOW - **Log flow.** How a log entry travels from a call
  site through rate limiting out to every sink.
*/
